window.ScripturaLexicons.LSJ.rowsHtml+="<tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1579\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1579\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1601\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀειδέλιος</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Equivalente ao verbete seguinte, ἀείδελος.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1580\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1580\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1602\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀείδελος</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Não visível, escuro, obscuro; também deslumbrante, impossível de olhar diretamente, segundo o contexto.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1581\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1581\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1603\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀειδής</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Sem forma, informe; indistinto; de aparência desagradável; eventual leitura errônea de ἀϊδής.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1582\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1582\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1604\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀειδία</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Deformidade, aparência disforme.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1583\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1583\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1605\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀειδίνητος</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Que gira ou revoluciona continuamente.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1584\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1584\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1606\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀείδιος</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Eterno, perpétuo; adjetivo formado de ἀεί.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1585\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1585\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1607\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀειδουλεία</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Escravidão perpétua; variante ἀειδουλία.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1586\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1586\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1608\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀειδράστεια</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Proposta de explicação etimológica de Ἀδράστεια; não estabelecer etimologia segura.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1587\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1587\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1609\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀείδω</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Cantar, entoar, celebrar em canto; produzir som vocal de aves ou outros animais; ressoar, assobiar, vibrar; cantar a alguém ou sobre algo; competir no canto. Flexão poética, dialetos e muitos usos documentados no TEI.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1588\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1588\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1610\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀειεστώ</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Existência eterna, ser eterno.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1589\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1589\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1611\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀειζωής</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Sempre vivo, dotado de vida perpétua.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1590\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1590\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1612\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀειζωία</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Vida eterna, existência perpétua.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1591\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1591\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1613\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀείζωος</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Sempre vivo, eterno; substantivado, seres imortais; de planta, perene ou sempre-verde; nomes de espécies botânicas do gênero Sempervivum e Sedum.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1593\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1593\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1614\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀείζωτος</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Sempre cingido, sempre preparado; interpretação provável, glosa antiga sem explicação.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1594\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1594\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1615\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀειζώων</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Sempre vivo, vivente perpétuo; de raio e ritos sagrados.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1595\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1595\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1616\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀειθαλής</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Sempre verde, sempre florescente; figuradamente, de vigor ou beleza duradouros.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1596\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1596\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1617\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀειθανής</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Que sempre morre ou teme constantemente a morte.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1597\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1597\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1618\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀειθερής</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Que sempre aquece; de região, onde faz sempre verão.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1598\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1598\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1619\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀειθέσσω</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Dizer a verdade, ser veraz: glosa ἀληθεύω.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1599\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1599\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1620\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀείθουρος</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Sempre guerreiro, incessantemente belicoso.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1600\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1600\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1621\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀειθρύλητος</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Sempre mencionado ou celebrado, frequentemente comentado.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1601\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1601\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1622\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀείκαρπος</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Que produz frutos continuamente.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1602\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1602\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1623\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀεικέλιος</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Forma poética correspondente a ἀεικής, «indecoroso, vergonhoso».</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1603\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1603\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1624\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀεικής</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Inconveniente, indecoroso, vergonhoso, miserável ou insuficiente; em certos contextos, estranho; prejudicial ou mortífero.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr><tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n1604\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n1604\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"1625\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀεικία</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Afronta, ultraje, injúria ou maus-tratos; forma ática correspondente αἰκία.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr>";
